WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:35.400
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:35.208
You're safe now.

00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:40.416
It's okay, Lin Zai.

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:42.958
I'm right here.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:06.500
Does it hurt?

00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:09.625
No.

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:23.583
I messed up.

00:01:26.791 --> 00:01:27.791
I shouldn't have...

00:01:28.625 --> 00:01:30.505
I shouldn't have eaten
those berries by myself.

00:01:32.791 --> 00:01:34.551
I never thought it
would turn out like this.

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:37.332
I really didn't expect them to...

00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:38.333
In the apocalypse,

00:01:40.041 --> 00:01:42.041
sometimes people are scarier than zombies.

00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:46.875
Don't ever hurt yourself again.

00:01:52.083 --> 00:01:53.083
A-Leh.

00:01:55.208 --> 00:01:57.208
I did all this because I want to go home.

00:01:59.458 --> 00:02:00.832
I finally found a place

00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:02.000
that felt like home.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:05.791
Sister Chen,

00:02:07.375 --> 00:02:08.375
Brother Li,

00:02:09.416 --> 00:02:10.416
Grandma Qiu.

00:02:12.041 --> 00:02:13.208
They treated me so well.

00:02:16.875 --> 00:02:18.833
But ever since you took me away,

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:21.750
every single day,

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:23.625
every day I...

00:02:23.626 --> 00:02:25.066
I never know what's going to happen.

00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:28.083
And when we reach the end,

00:02:29.083 --> 00:02:30.625
what's waiting for me there?

00:02:39.416 --> 00:02:40.416
A-Leh,

00:02:40.625 --> 00:02:41.750
I'm begging you.

00:02:42.958 --> 00:02:44.250
Please, just let me go.

00:03:47.541 --> 00:03:48.541
Lin Zai.

00:03:51.125 --> 00:03:52.125
From now on,

00:03:54.333 --> 00:03:55.750
I'll protect you.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:35.000
"The Last Oath"

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:40.000
(Episode 9: What Mom Owes You)

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:11.250
Hold on a second.

00:06:20.666 --> 00:06:21.833
What are you doing?

00:06:22.041 --> 00:06:23.521
Teaching you how to protect yourself.

00:06:36.291 --> 00:06:37.375
Turn your body to the side.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.370
Keep your left arm straight.

00:06:42.166 --> 00:06:43.958
Nock the arrow with your right hand.

00:06:45.666 --> 00:06:46.666
Like this.

00:06:49.166 --> 00:06:50.166
Then draw your hand back

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:51.583
right under your cheek.

00:06:55.333 --> 00:06:56.573
Keep your eye and hand in line.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:57.750
Focus on the target.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.083
The bottle is your target.

00:07:02.458 --> 00:07:03.458
Give it a try.

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:14.291
Same motion as before.

00:07:27.208 --> 00:07:28.208
Keep your arm straight.

00:07:31.125 --> 00:07:32.916
Are you teaching me archery or what?

00:07:34.833 --> 00:07:35.833
I'm teaching you archery.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.333
Your mind isn't calm enough.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:43.530
Don't think about anything else.

00:07:44.166 --> 00:07:45.166
Just look at the target.

00:07:50.791 --> 00:07:51.791
And whose fault is that?

00:07:54.791 --> 00:07:56.591
Don't think about this
being your first time.

00:07:56.666 --> 00:07:57.458
You are the arrow.

00:07:57.583 --> 00:07:58.583
And the arrow is you.

00:08:03.416 --> 00:08:04.458
Can I shoot now?

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.250
Shoot.

00:08:21.041 --> 00:08:22.041
Come here.

00:08:40.375 --> 00:08:41.735
What exactly are you trying to do?

00:08:42.708 --> 00:08:43.750
It's yours now.

00:08:44.166 --> 00:08:45.166
Protect yourself.

00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:34.166
Is this your car?

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.000
Yeah.

00:09:38.041 --> 00:09:39.441
Looks like it's been tampered with.

00:09:40.541 --> 00:09:41.541
It's out of gas.

00:09:42.375 --> 00:09:43.815
Then we need to find some gas first.

00:10:00.041 --> 00:10:00.791
For me?

00:10:00.958 --> 00:10:01.291
Yeah.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:03.333
Change out of those dirty clothes.

00:10:03.583 --> 00:10:05.223
Once you're done, we'll go find some gas.

00:10:13.916 --> 00:10:14.916
What's wrong?

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.000
Don't like it?

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:04.950
Keep it safe for your brother.

00:11:48.125 --> 00:11:49.125
Let's go find some gas.

00:12:33.916 --> 00:12:34.916
Hey, you two.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.000
I don't mean any harm.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:37.750
This car...

00:12:38.041 --> 00:12:39.041
is yours?

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:41.833
Leave the gas and you can go.

00:12:43.541 --> 00:12:44.541
Buddy,

00:12:44.666 --> 00:12:46.106
that's a bit harsh, don't you think?

00:12:46.458 --> 00:12:48.125
I went through hell to find this gas.

00:12:48.583 --> 00:12:49.583
You expect me to just hand it over?

00:12:49.583 --> 00:12:50.583
Not for nothing.

00:12:50.791 --> 00:12:52.271
In exchange for me sparing your life.

00:12:53.333 --> 00:12:54.333
You...

00:13:01.916 --> 00:13:03.125
There are zombies around here.

00:13:04.125 --> 00:13:05.291
I can give you the gas,

00:13:05.666 --> 00:13:07.186
but I'm hoping you can give me a ride.

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:08.291
It's not far.

00:13:08.416 --> 00:13:09.916
Just a bit further down this road,

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:11.410
there's Green Island Airport.

00:13:11.625 --> 00:13:12.375
Once we get there,

00:13:12.376 --> 00:13:13.458
you can just drop me off.

00:13:13.958 --> 00:13:14.958
What do you say?

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:16.860
That's not asking too much, right?

00:13:18.541 --> 00:13:19.541
Don't come any closer!

00:13:20.708 --> 00:13:21.948
I'll dump the gas if I have to!

00:13:22.208 --> 00:13:23.208
Then nobody gets it!

00:13:42.958 --> 00:13:44.038
Hurry up and fill the tank!

00:14:37.625 --> 00:14:38.625
Damn it!